<title>FINLAND: INGMAN SWINGS TO FIM 7.4 MLN 4-MTH PROFIT.</title>
<headline>INGMAN SWINGS TO FIM 7.4 MLN 4-MTH PROFIT.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Four months to April 30,</p>
<p>					   (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Profit after fin items			   7.4 vs 3.2 loss</p>
<p> Earnings per share (markka)		   5.90 vs 3.72 loss</p>
<p> Net sales					  351.5 vs 339.3</p>
<p> Operating profit				  10.5 vs 5.0</p>
<p> Operating profit before depreciation	23.6 vs 18.5</p>
<p> Depreciation					13.1 vs 13.5</p>
<p> Net financial items		     charge 3.1 vs 8.2 charge</p>
<p>Share in associated companies'</p>
<p> results					 gain 1.9 vs 2.7 gain</p>
<p> Extraordinary items				nil vs 0.6 gain</p>
<p> Profit before appropriations, taxes	  9.3 vs 0.1</p>
<p> Equity to assets ratio (percent)	    48.2 vs 46.3</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of Finnish dairy products maker is Ingman</p>
<p>Foods Oy Ab.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358 0 680 50 240, news@reuters.fi</p>
